        <mxCell id="bg_modl" parent="1" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#fff7cc;strokeColor=#c9b347;verticalAlign=top;fontStyle=1;fontSize=12;" value="model  (Diffusion_Planner.forward:20 → Encoder[与DP同] + Decoder/DiT[HDP重构])" vertex="1">
          <mxGeometry height="370" width="1640" x="30" y="790" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="dp2" parent="1" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#fff1b3;strokeColor=#9c8a1f;" value="◄输入← merged_inputs = {**inputs, sampled_trajectories=xT[B,80,4], diffusion_time=t[B]}&#xa;►输出→ (encoder_outputs, decoder_outputs{&#39;score&#39;:[B,80,4]})&#xa;Diffusion_Planner.forward:20 (diffusion_planner.py:9)&#xa;encoder(inputs) → decoder(encoding, inputs)" vertex="1">
          <mxGeometry height="90" width="440" x="850" y="830" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="enc" parent="1" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#fff1b3;strokeColor=#9c8a1f;" value="◄输入← inputs{neighbor_past[B,32,21,11], static[B,5,10], lanes[B,70,20,12], route_lanes[B,25,20,12], ...}&#xa;►输出→ encoding[B,107,192] (32+5+70=107 token)&#xa;Encoder.forward (encoder.py:32) ← 与 DP 完全相同&#xa;AgentFusionEncoder/StaticFusionEncoder/LaneFusionEncoder&#xa;→ cat 107 token → pos_emb → FusionEncoder(3×SelfAttentionBlock)" vertex="1">
          <mxGeometry height="160" width="420" x="50" y="950" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="dec" parent="1" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#fff1b3;strokeColor=#9c8a1f;" value="◄输入← encoding[B,107,192] + inputs{sampled_trajectories=xT[B,80,4], diffusion_time=t[B], ego_current_state[B,10]}&#xa;►输出→ {&#39;score&#39;:[B,80,4]}（⚠ ego-only，无 turn_indicator，无邻居预测）&#xa;Decoder.forward:41 (decoder.py:14)&#xa;ego_current = inputs[&#39;ego_current_state&#39;][:,:4] → [B,1,4]&#xa;ego_v = ego_current[:,2:4] → [B,2] (vx,vy) ← HDP 新增：注入当前速度&#xa;sampled_trajectories = inputs[&#39;sampled_trajectories&#39;] → [B,80,4]&#xa;→ self.dit(sampled_trajectories, t, encoding, route_lanes, ego_v) → score[B,80,4]" vertex="1">
          <mxGeometry height="200" width="440" x="550" y="950" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="dit" parent="1" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#fff1b3;strokeColor=#9c8a1f;" value="◄输入← x[B,80,4] + t[B] + cross_c[B,107,192] + route_lanes[B,25,20,12] + ego_current_states[B,2](vx,vy)&#xa;►输出→ score/x_start [B,80,4]&#xa;DiT.forward:185 (decoder.py:165)&#xa;x=preproj(4→512→192) [B,80,192]&#xa;x+=agent_embedding.weight(Embedding(80,192)) [B,80,192] ← per-timestep（非 ego/neighbor 角色）&#xa;x+=ego_state_proj(Linear(2→192))(ego_v) [B,1,192] ← HDP 新增：注入 vx,vy&#xa;y=RouteEncoder(route_lanes)→[B,192] + t_embedder(t)→[B,192]&#xa;3×DiTBlock:66(x, cond=cross_c, y) → FinalLayer:96 → [B,80,4]&#xa;★ HDP 特性: 80 timestep token(非11 agent); 9*dim adaLN(非6); 全门控(self+cross+MLP); 无 attn_mask" vertex="1">
          <mxGeometry height="200" width="520" x="1130" y="930" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="e30" edge="1" parent="1" source="loss" style="edgeStyle=orthogonalEdgeStyle;html=1;" target="dp2">
          <mxGeometry relative="1" as="geometry">
            <Array as="points">
              <mxPoint x="310" y="770" />
